/-  Arb4_h4000.lean -- lane Arb4: the height-4000 ladder statement, HYPOTHESIS-FREE, from COMPACT
    certificates (GENERATED by ../Arb4_emit_seg.py; do not edit).

        all_nontrivial_zeros_up_to_height_4000 :
          ∀ ρ : ℂ, riemannZeta ρ = 0 → 0 < ρ.im → ρ.im ≤ 4000 → ρ.re = 1 / 2

    Every input of the 25 Turing bands of `Arb4.BandGlue_h4000.seg` (the band plan of `AllZeros_h4000`) is
    discharged in the kernel by ONE Boolean checker per certificate (lane Arb4):
      * hLine: `Arb4.bandC` per band (`ptCheckC` chunks + `bandOk`; modules Arb4_H4000Lines_*);
      * the edge-clearance slabs: `Arb4.slabOK` (Arb4_H4000Slabs_*);
      * the horizontal argument changes: `Arb4.edgeOK` (Arb4_H4000Edges_*; the edge at 3000 is Arb4_H3000Edges);
      * K6a (`[-249/250, 249/250]`), K6b (`Arb4.k6B`: S2 / Sm1 brackets), the ball cover and the
        pins of `Valid`: ONE `decide +kernel` of `Arb4.validB && Arb4.k6sideB` per band;
      * hnzl, hnzb, hnzt, hins: K1 (`BandGlue.BandData.inputs_of_reduced`); hγ: `HeightFloor`.
    Composition: `Arb4.boxCert_of_parts` per band, then `AllZerosUpToHeight.height_chain (Arb4_h3000 + AllZeros_h4000.segment_3000_4000)`.
    Axioms [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound] (Arb4_AxiomGuard_h4000); no `sorry`.
    conjecture1_proved = False.  Finite verification up to a fixed height only.
-/
